# Applies to the build context at the repository root (docker build -f data-platform/Dockerfile ... .).
# Everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is let back in: the event schemas are read at runtime;
# no .env, no keys, no tests, no other service.
*
!contracts/schemas
!contracts/schemas/events
!contracts/schemas/events/**
!data-platform/requirements.txt
!data-platform/migrations
!data-platform/migrations/**
!data-platform/src
!data-platform/src/**
**/__pycache__
